\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Keynote Talks:} By distinguished researchers from academia and industry (e.g., on LLM-based data synthesis, responsible synthetic data, and evaluation frameworks).
        \begin{itemize}
            \item Sunita Sarawagi, Professor, Indian Institute of Technology, Bombay, India.
