        \end{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Paper Presentations:} Accepted peer-reviewed papers (in short and long formats) that highlight novel research and practical systems.
    \item \textbf{Panel Discussions:} To discuss “Responsible Synthetic Data in Open and Enterprise Research.”
    \item \textbf{Poster and Demo Sessions:} For early-stage research and prototype systems.
\end{itemize}


